sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (host)
    participant Booking

    Note over Booking: status is pending, waiting for the host's decision
    
    alt host accepts
        User ->> Booking: confirm_booking()
        Note over Booking: status: pending → confirmed 
        Booking -->> User: booking confirmed

    else host rejects
        User ->> Booking: cancel_booking()
        Note over Booking: status: pending → cancelled
        Booking -->> User: booking cancelled
    end
